# GMS: 112+3x% fifteen times, a 110+3x% burn for thirty seconds, and a wait
# that shortens from 20 seconds to 10 as the skill is levelled. GMS also holds
# the enemy untouchable, slows it and lays a Poison Mist where it lands, none
# of which has anything to act on here.
#
# Both halves are GMS's x2.8, which makes this the book's single-target lever.
# Flame Sweep is a much smaller swing than the I/L Arch Mage's Chain Lightning
# -- 1400% against 2200% on the same clock -- and GMS pays that back with five
# more damage-over-time sources, Poison Nova and DoT Punisher, none of which
# this game has. One skill carries all of it, and it is this one, because it
# reaches a single enemy and so cannot touch what the class does to a room.
name: "Flame Haze"
skill_order: 4
description:
  "Wrap one enemy in burning mist, striking it hard and leaving it to burn "
  "for a long while."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
